p/coinography-run-20260618-064814-7609-25204/research/raw.json`.\\n6. **Self-Check Pass**: Verified output against the self-check tool `check_research.py` confirming a perfect match (`RESEARCH_CHECK: PASS`).\\n\\n### Extracted Highlights & Factoids:\\n* **The Event:** On June 17, 2026, the Malta Financial Services Authority (MFSA) released a strategic discussion paper on DeFi.\\n* **The Goal:** To seek industry feedback on how decentralized protocols can align with the European Union's Markets in Crypto-Assets (MiCA) regulation.\\n* **Key Proposals:**\\n  * Potential introduction of **segregated cell company (SCC) structures** tailored for DeFi environments to ring-fence assets and liabilities.\\n  * Concept of **\\\"Guardian Agents\\\"**—automated code-based tools that embed risk controls and enforce market integrity within protocols.\\n  * Analysis of **account abstraction** and how it impacts governance and compliance.\\n* **Timeline:** The public consultation period is currently open with feedback accepted until **July 10, 2026**.\",\"_meta\":{\"runtime\":\"node\",\"runtimeVersion\":\"22.22.2\",\"hostname\":\"unknown\",\"name\":\"openclaw\",\"date\":\"2026-06-18T07:07:47.121Z\",\"logLevelId\":3,\"logLevelName\":\"INFO\",\"path\":{\"fullFilePath\":\"file:///home/bhard/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/dist/subsystem-bmJ5rL4Q.js:160:46\",\"fileName\":\"subsystem-bmJ5rL4Q.js\",\"fileNameWithLine\":\"subsystem-bmJ5rL4Q.js:160\",\"fileColumn\":\"46\",\"fileLine\":\"160\",\"filePath\":\"/home/bhard/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/dist/subsystem-bmJ5rL4Q.js\",\"filePathWithLine\":\"/home/bhard/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/dist/subsystem-bmJ5rL4Q.js:160\"}},\"time\":\"2026-06-18T07:07:47.121+00:00\"}\n{\"0\":\"No reply from agent.\",\"_meta\":{\"runtime\":\"node\",\"runtimeVersion\":\"22.22.2\",\"hostname\":\"unknown\",\"name\":\"openclaw\",\"date\":\"2026-06-18T07:08:50.119Z\",\"logLevelId\":3,\"logLevelName\":\"INFO\",\"path\":{\"fullFilePath\":\"fi